# Why We Open-Sourced This

We are handing over the keys to a system designed to capture hundreds of thousands of dollars in hidden talent value.

We believe AI should help recruiters/scouts discover talent not replace their expertise.

Too many recruitment tools force organizations into rigid workflows or require them to replace systems that already work well. Talent Prism takes a different approach.

By sharing this reference implementation, our goal is to demonstrate how configurable AI evaluation, workflow automation, and secure infrastructure can be combined into a flexible foundation that organizations can adapt to their own standards, markets, and recruitment philosophy.

We hope it accelerates innovation across the talent industry and enables more organizations to build tools that allow recruiters to focus on what they do best: recognizing potential that no algorithm can fully understand.

